WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
An opening’s visual shape does not prove its function. Treat a cooling claim as a hypothesis until the air path is supported.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Mark a possible inlet and outlet, then sketch a continuous route through the heat exchanger before calling it a duct.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Evidence matching

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A view can support interpretation; it cannot prove hidden structure or compliance by itself.

